  "id": "https://samsm.ch/portfolio-iii/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Portfolio III - 2018",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eHaving finished my \u003ca href=\"/portfolio-ii/\"\u003elast portfolio\u003c/a\u003e\nat the end of 2017 I can now start doing them yearly, so this one covers 2018.\nThis includes two trips to the Canary islands, one to Gran Canaria in March and\nanother to Fuerteventura in December as well as another long trip around Asia in\nthe summer.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eHaving finished my \u003ca href=\"/portfolio-ii/\"\u003elast portfolio\u003c/a\u003e\nat the end of 2017 I can now start doing them yearly, so this one covers 2018.\nThis includes two trips to the Canary islands, one to Gran Canaria in March and\nanother to Fuerteventura in December as well as another long trip around Asia in\nthe summer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2018 is also the year during which I started to become more interested in\ncollections of images rather than just single photos. I shot two rather short\nprojects over the year, \u003ca href=\"/subways/\"\u003eSubways\u003c/a\u003e and\n\u003ca href=\"/campus-lights/\"\u003eCampus Lights\u003c/a\u003e.\nI also attended a photo sequencing workshop at The Photo Parlour in Nottingham\nas part of the Off-Centre photo festival during which we looked at a selection\nof prints of my photos taken in China, which I have continued to work on.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/7102/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/7102/7102.avif\"\n         title=\"Clifton Bridge\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"7102\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eClifton Bridge\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/7512/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/7512/7512.avif\"\n         title=\"Barranco de los Mocanes\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"7512\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eBarranco de los Mocanes\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8101/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8101/8101.avif\"\n         title=\"Two Leaves\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8101\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eTwo Leaves\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8405/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8405/8405.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 01\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8405\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 01\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8505/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8505/8505.avif\"\n         title=\"Cascade Cavern\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8505\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eCascade Cavern\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/9204/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/9204/9204.avif\"\n         title=\"Macaque\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"9204\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eMacaque\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/9609/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/9609/9609.avif\"\n         title=\"Scrap Collectors\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"9609\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eScrap Collectors\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/10601/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/10601/10601.avif\"\n         title=\"Victoria Harbour\"\n         alt=\"Black and white photo showing a night scene showing the skyline of Hong Kong with victoria harbour in the centre\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"10601\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eVictoria Harbour\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/10603/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/10603/10603.avif\"\n         title=\"Queen\u0026#39;s Road Central\"\n         alt=\"Black and white photo of a street from above at night, lined by tall buildings. A truck with two people at the rear sits at the junction while some streaked lights suggests a car passes\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"10603\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eQueen's Road Central\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/10711/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/10711/10711.avif\"\n         title=\"Ronghu Lake\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of an ancient looking small boat on a lake with an ornate bridge between many trees in the background\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"10711\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eRonghu Lake\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/10906/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/10906/10906.avif\"\n         title=\"Yuzhong\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking across a large river at a dense cluster of medium and large skyscrapers, with boats on the river at the base\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"10906\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eYuzhong\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12407/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12407/12407.avif\"\n         title=\"Towards Triquivijate\"\n         alt=\"Black and white photo showing silhouetted hills with 3 electricity pylons on the left, heading into the distance, with the top wire between them decorated with periodic lights. Some star streaks can be seen around the centre of the frame\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12407\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eTowards Triquivijate\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs usual all of these images were shot with my Hasselblad 500C/M and 60mm CF and\n150mm CF lenses on Ilford film, although with a bit more variation that last\nyear as I have included one shot taken on Delta 100 and one on Pan F+ but the\nrest are my usual HP5+. There\u0026rsquo;s also more photos taken with my 60mm lens\nincluded this year than there was last year.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "url": "https://samsm.ch/portfolio-iii/",
  "published": "2019-06-18T00:00:00Z",
